{title: Tu Aas Hai Meri}
{artist: Omer Nadeem}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
Tu [F]aas hai meri,        Tu [Am]pyaas hai meri
Tu [Dm]hi [C]dhadkano mein [F]rahe,        Tu [F]hi zindagi hai
[Am]Tujhse har khushi hai,        Tu [Dm]hi [C]aashiqui dil [F]kahe
Chaahe [Gm]jitni bhi ho,        [F]Uljhane par na dekhun main
[C]Aansoo [Am]teri aankhon [F]mein,        Mera [A#]dil ro raha hai
[Dm]Pukaare Tujhe ab,        Ye [C]raste [Am]meri saanson [F]ke
Tu [F]aas hai meri,        Tu [Am]pyaas hai meri
Tu [Dm]hi [C]dhadkano mein [F]rahe,        Tu [F]hi zindagi hai
[Am]Tujhse har khushi hai,        Tu [Dm]hi [C]aashiqui dil [F]kahe
[Am]Na jaane mujhe [F]raaton mein,        [A#]Tadpaaye yaadein [Gm]teri
[C]Sone na [A#]de mujhe,        [C]Sataaye wo baatein [F]teri
[Am]Na jaane mujhe [F]raaton mein,        [A#]Tadpaaye yaadein [Gm]teri
[C]Sone na [A#]de mujhe,        [C]Sataaye wo baatein [F]teri
Tu [Gm]wafaaon mein meri,        [F]Duaaon me meri
[C]Hamesha hi [Am]shaamil [F]rahe,        Mera [A#]dil ro raha hai
[Dm]Pukaare tujhe ab,        Ye [C]raste [Am]meri saanson [F]ke
Tu [F]aas hai meri,        Tu [Am]pyaas hai meri
Tu [Dm]hi [C]dhadkano mein [F]rahe,        Tu [F]hi zindagi hai
[Am]Tujhse har khushi hai,        Tu [Dm]hi [C]aashiqui dil [F]kahe
[Am]Bin tere khoye [F]khoye se,        [A#]Mere savere [Gm]hue
[C]Mit jaayein tere [A#]jeevan se,        [C]Jitne andhere [F]hue
[Am]Bin tere khoye [F]khoye se,        [A#]Mere savere [Gm]hue
[C]Mit jaayein tere [A#]jeevan se,        [C]Jitne andhere [F]hue
Tu [Gm]leher khushiyon ki,        Tu hi [F]toh hai ujaala
[C]Meri saansein [Am]tujhse [F]chalein,        Mera [A#]dil ro raha hai
[Dm]Pukaare tujhe ab,        Ye [C]raste [Am]meri saanson [F]ke
Tu [F]aas hai meri,        Tu [Am]pyaas hai meri
Tu [Dm]hi [C]dhadkano mein [F]rahe,        Tu [F]hi zindagi hai
[Am]Tujhse har khushi hai,        Tu [Dm]hi [C]aashiqui dil [F]kahe
